---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant ControlDB as Control DB
    participant ExecutionDB as Execution DBs
    participant Queue as RabbitMQ

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo coordinator start
    activate Vigilo
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Load throughput knobs and generate coordinator id
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Start coordinator service loop

    loop Until shutdown or service failure
        alt Shutdown signal received
            User->>Vigilo: Shutdown signal
            Vigilo->>Vigilo: Cancel loop and wait for service stop
            Vigilo-->>User: Success response
        else Tick elapsed
            Vigilo->>Vigilo: Run coordinator cycle
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: List active execution placements
            Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Recover expired chunk leases per placement
            ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Recovered and failed chunk counts
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Log dispatch cursor backlog
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Drain dispatchable run-shard cursors
            Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Dispatch routed chunk windows
            ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Dispatch shard window count
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Log finalization candidate backlog
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Claim finalizable runs
            Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Read routed shard summaries
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Write global finalization result
            ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Finalization count
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: List active outbox placements
            Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Log publishable outbox backlog per placement
            Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Claim publishable outbox rows per placement
            ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Joined event payload batches
            loop Bounded outbox publish concurrency
                Vigilo->>Queue: Declare durable topology and publish persistent mandatory events
            end
            Queue-->>Vigilo: Confirmed routed publishes or returned/nacked publishes
            Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Mark ledger published and delete or retry delivery rows
        else Cycle or shutdown fails
            Vigilo-->>User: Service error
        end
    end
    deactivate Vigilo
